  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Definition> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Do three sample means settle the decision? No. The same separation is less persuasive when within-group scatter is larger."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Definition> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "At a familywise level of 0.05, A vs B and B vs C show evidence of a difference. A vs C remains inconclusive."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Definition> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "What does ANOVA test? Equal population means, against the alternative that not all are equal."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
