  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Definition> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-05> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-05> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "What is replicated? A sample preparation, not another injection of the same extract."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-05> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-05> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Definition> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-06> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-06> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Where does variability come from? Observations vary within methods, and method sample means differ from one another."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-06> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-06> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-08> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Definition> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "How does one departure split? The total departure is a within-group residual plus a group-mean departure."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
