  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-09> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Definition> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Why do the sums of squares add? Centered group residuals make the mixed term vanish."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-definition-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
