  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Sample means and sizes for the original synthetic river-water data"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/formulaLabel> "Sample means and sizes for the original synthetic river-water data"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-package> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/latex> "\\begin{aligned}\\bar{x}_i&=\\frac{1}{n_i}\\sum_{j=1}^{n_i} y_{ij},\\quad n_i=6\\\\[4pt]\\bar{x}_A&=94\\%,\\quad\\bar{x}_B=98\\%,\\quad\\bar{x}_C=93\\%\\end{aligned}" .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasPart> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-legend-03> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-A> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-B> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-C> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/MathExpression> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Two-sided pooled t-tests and Bonferroni adjustment"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/formulaLabel> "Two-sided pooled t-tests and Bonferroni adjustment"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-package> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/latex> "\\begin{gathered}s_p^2=\\frac{(n_i-1)s_i^2+(n_j-1)s_j^2}{n_i+n_j-2},\\quad \\nu=n_i+n_j-2\\\\ t_{ij}=\\frac{\\bar y_i-\\bar y_j}{s_p\\sqrt{1/n_i+1/n_j}}\\\\ p_{ij}=2\\Pr(T_\\nu\\ge |t_{ij}|),\\quad p_{\\mathrm{adj},ij}=\\min(1,m p_{ij}),\\quad m=3\\end{gathered}" .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-04> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasPart> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-legend-04> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-04> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-A> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-04> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-B> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-04> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-C> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/MathExpression> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "One joint population-means hypothesis"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/formulaLabel> "One joint population-means hypothesis"@en .
