  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-package> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
