  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "A signed total departure is the sum of two signed departures"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/formulaLabel> "A signed total departure is the sum of two signed departures"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-package> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/latex> "y_{ij}-\\bar{x}=(y_{ij}-\\bar{x}_i)+(\\bar{x}_i-\\bar{x})" .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasPart> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-legend-09> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-A> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-B> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-C> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/MathExpression> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Partition squared departures; the mixed term vanishes"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/formulaLabel> "Partition squared departures; the mixed term vanishes"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-nist-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-package> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-source-scipy-anova> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/latex> "\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{SS}_T&=\\sum_i\\sum_j(y_{ij}-\\bar{x})^2\\\\\\mathrm{SS}_W&=\\sum_i\\sum_j(y_{ij}-\\bar{x}_i)^2\\\\\\mathrm{SS}_B&=\\sum_i n_i(\\bar{x}_i-\\bar{x})^2\\\\\\mathrm{SS}_T&=\\mathrm{SS}_B+\\mathrm{SS}_W\\\\2\\sum_i(\\bar{x}_i-\\bar{x})\\sum_j(y_{ij}-\\bar{x}_i)&=0\\end{aligned}" .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-10> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasPart> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-legend-10> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-10> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-A> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-10> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-B> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-10> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-spe-R-C> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/MathExpression> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-10> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-10> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Degrees of freedom split between contrasts and residuals"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-formula-10> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/formulaLabel> "Degrees of freedom split between contrasts and residuals"@en .
