  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-parameter-02-withinScale> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/parameterMinimum> "0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
