  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-takeaway-01> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-takeaway-01> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Which response and factor define the analytical decision? Compare population mean recovery, using independent preparations as the units."@en .
