  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-takeaway-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-takeaway-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "At a familywise level of 0.05, A vs B and B vs C show evidence of a difference. A vs C remains inconclusive."@en .
