  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-takeaway-05> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/l7-intro-takeaway-05> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "What is replicated? A sample preparation, not another injection of the same extract."@en .
